WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.917 --> 00:00:16.438
Meltron sounds hard!"

2
00:00:16.818 --> 00:00:17.458
Roxy said.

3
00:00:17.478 --> 00:00:19.299
"Where is he?"

4
00:00:19.319 --> 00:00:21.540
"Here," Dr.

5
00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:22.120
Odd said.

6
00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:25.222
"He's deep below the surface, at Groon's core."

7
00:00:26.782 --> 00:00:27.903
He typed on a computer.

8
00:00:29.303 --> 00:00:30.804
A hologram of Groon appeared.

9
00:00:32.124 --> 00:00:35.346
It showed what Groon was like now, covered in machinery and metal.

10
00:00:36.827 --> 00:00:38.988
Just then Roxy heard a cup shatter on the floor.

11
00:00:40.149 --> 00:00:41.950
Dr. Odd's tea spilled everywhere.

12
00:00:46.833 --> 00:00:48.674
me," a tiny robot said.

13
00:00:49.614 --> 00:00:51.035
It was round with big eyes.

14
00:00:52.296 --> 00:00:53.476
Dr. Odd groaned.

15
00:00:54.137 --> 00:00:55.658
"Be careful, Bippo!"

16
00:00:56.918 --> 00:00:57.919
The robot looked down.

17
00:01:02.504 --> 00:01:02.884
"Sorry, me."

18
00:01:02.924 --> 00:01:04.024
"Aw!" Roxy said.

19
00:01:04.084 --> 00:01:04.545
"He's cute!"

20
00:01:05.585 --> 00:01:07.165
Bippo hurried over to Roxy.

21
00:01:07.185 --> 00:01:10.146
"Friend, you!"

22
00:01:11.306 --> 00:01:12.767
He jumped onto Roxy's shoulder.

23
00:01:12.787 --> 00:01:15.868
"Anyway," Dr.

24
00:01:15.968 --> 00:01:20.769
Odd said, "I have been doing deep scans of Groon since I arrived."

25
00:01:21.509 --> 00:01:22.650
Bippo pointed at Dr.

26
00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:24.870
Odd. "Busy, him!"

27
00:01:26.051 --> 00:01:26.751
Roxy giggled.

28
00:01:29.592 --> 00:01:30.892
Dr. Odd rolled his eyes.

29
00:01:33.184 --> 00:01:36.626
"Groon is covered in multiple layers of metal and machinery.

30
00:01:37.847 --> 00:01:43.350
These layers have a network of tunnels and rooms that Meltron's robots use to move around."

31
00:01:44.511 --> 00:01:47.032
Dr. Odd waved his hand to make the hologram zoom in.

32
00:01:49.654 --> 00:01:52.796
"My scanners can't reach the center of the planet," Dr.

33
00:01:52.876 --> 00:01:53.376
Odd said.

34
00:01:53.396 --> 00:01:56.478
"But I'm sure Meltron is down there.

35
00:01:57.478 --> 00:01:59.820
Strong signals are coming from Groon's core.

36
00:02:01.152 --> 00:02:04.053
The signals seem to control all the other robots.

37
00:02:05.333 --> 00:02:06.174
It must be him."

38
00:02:07.434 --> 00:02:09.915
He waved his hand again, and the hologram zoomed out.

39
00:02:10.775 --> 00:02:14.156
Roxy and Cozlin saw a glowing layer just below the surface.

40
00:02:14.176 --> 00:02:17.397
"That's the energy shield!"

41
00:02:17.817 --> 00:02:18.537
Cozlin said.

42
00:02:18.557 --> 00:02:20.778
"You know about that?"

43
00:02:21.058 --> 00:02:21.998
Dr. Odd asked.

44
00:02:23.279 --> 00:02:24.019
Roxy nodded.

45
00:02:24.039 --> 00:02:28.068
"It took away our super powers."

46
00:02:28.088 --> 00:02:32.812
"That energy shield disrupts any technology that's not from Meltron," Dr.

47
00:02:32.892 --> 00:02:33.372
Odd said.

48
00:02:33.392 --> 00:02:36.675
"It's part of Meltron's defense system.

49
00:02:37.676 --> 00:02:41.279
Because of it, I can't pilot my big robot inside the planet."

50
00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:43.821
He sighed.

51
00:02:43.841 --> 00:02:50.686
"I didn't realize the energy shield worked on super powers too.

52
00:02:52.007 --> 00:02:53.308
We'll need to disable it."

53
00:02:56.491 --> 00:02:57.652
He zoomed in on a computer.

54
00:02:59.744 --> 00:03:03.285
"That's the computer that controls the energy shield," Dr.

55
00:03:03.365 --> 00:03:03.825
Odd said.

56
00:03:03.845 --> 00:03:07.926
"If I can get to it, I can turn off the energy shield.

57
00:03:08.906 --> 00:03:11.087
Then you two won't lose your powers again."

58
00:03:11.107 --> 00:03:18.089
"That sounds like a good plan," Cozlin said, "but Meltron has a lot of robots.

59
00:03:19.289 --> 00:03:24.191
I hate to admit it, but we can't fight them all and fight Meltron too!"

60
00:03:25.891 --> 00:03:26.831
Roxy bit her lip.

61
00:03:26.851 --> 00:03:29.292
"Kid Comet is right.

62
00:03:30.464 --> 00:03:35.608
The robots are kind of easy to fight, but—" "Strong, you," Bippo said.

63
00:03:35.628 --> 00:03:38.271
"Thanks, Bippo," Roxy said.

64
00:03:38.291 --> 00:03:40.953
"But there are way too many of them.

65
00:03:41.573 --> 00:03:44.216
It could be hard to get past them to reach Meltron."

66
00:03:45.437 --> 00:03:46.858
Dr. Odd tapped his chin.

67
00:03:50.461 --> 00:03:53.443
we'll have to disable Meltron's controller as well."

68
00:03:53.463 --> 00:03:57.747
"We don't know where that is, do we?"

69
00:03:58.007 --> 00:03:58.748
Roxy asked.

70
00:04:00.192 --> 00:04:01.553
Dr. Odd rolled his eyes.

71
00:04:01.573 --> 00:04:04.695
"Did you forget, Rocket Girl?

72
00:04:05.715 --> 00:04:08.677
I'm Earth's leading expert on robot technology.

73
00:04:09.557 --> 00:04:11.118
I know where the controller is."

74
00:04:11.138 --> 00:04:14.560
"Smart, him," Bippo said.

75
00:04:14.580 --> 00:04:16.541
"Where is it?"

76
00:04:16.941 --> 00:04:17.682
Cozlin asked.

77
00:04:18.662 --> 00:04:20.183
Dr. Odd gave a nervous laugh.

78
00:04:20.203 --> 00:04:24.486
"Inside Meltron."

79
00:04:26.267 --> 00:04:27.227
"Are you kidding?"

80
00:04:27.627 --> 00:04:28.328
Cozlin said.

81
00:04:28.864 --> 00:04:31.686
"How will we get inside Meltron?"

82
00:04:32.847 --> 00:04:33.868
Dr. Odd shrugged.

83
00:04:35.269 --> 00:04:35.970
"I don't know."

84
00:04:41.515 --> 00:04:42.195
Roxy said.

85
00:04:42.215 --> 00:04:44.857
"I know someone who can make himself tiny!"

86
00:04:46.239 --> 00:04:47.119
Then she sighed.

87
00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:49.501
"Never mind."

88
00:04:50.962 --> 00:04:52.083
Cozlin scratched her head.

89
00:04:52.103 --> 00:04:57.308
"Why?" "We have no way to find him," Roxy said.

90
00:04:58.456 --> 00:04:59.912
"He's in another world!"
